Episode 39
 Door to the 
New World

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.330
That's a Gundam!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.420
What's a Gundam doing here?{Why is a Gundam here?}

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:13.840
{Return}Come back, Kio.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.920
I already told you.

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.590
This voice...

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:20.510
<i>Could it be?</i>

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:28.350
I said you would witness the world of 
Vagan as representative of the Earth Sphere.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.770
Mr. Ezelcant?

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.440
I see.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.980
The enemy's boss decides to show himself.{So that's the enemy's big boss?}

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.190
<i>Captain!</i>

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.070
Move aside! We'll handle this!

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.530
Retreat, Captain!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.620
Wait!

00:03:57.210 --> 00:03:58.920
In just an instant...

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:03.260
I'll draw his attention.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.640
<i>Use that chance to escape.</i>

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.890
<i>I'll send you the data for the rendezvous point!</i>

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:08.850
But!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:09.850
<i>Just go!</i>

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:13.140
I came this far to rescue you!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.130
<i>Now! Go, Kio!</i>

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.090
But...

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:42.130
<i>Go! I'll be right behind you!</i>

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.110
Go, bits.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:57.370
<i>This Gundam Legilis is a new unit</i>

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:01.960
<i>created by combining analysis of the 
AGE-3 with technology from the EXA-DB.</i>

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.380
<i>You have no chance of winning!{you have no chance to survive make your time}</i>

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:09.970
Come back, Kio.

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.760
<i>You haven't finished the task I gave you yet.</i>

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:20.650
I can't do that.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.570
I met many people in the Mars Sphere,

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:28.150
and I know now that not all Vagans are evil people.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.990
But I have to go back!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:36.700
There are people waiting for me in the Earth Sphere!

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:38.620
Kio...

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.290
So I can't go back with you.

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:45.500
Then fight me.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:48.920
You cannot return to Earth unless you defeat me.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:50.430
<i>I can't do that either.</i>

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:57.480
I... could never fight you.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.060
<i>Do you...</i>

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:04.270
Do you think that you can survive with such a weak mindset?!{ it's fine to live with such a weak mindset?!}

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:10.660
Bastard!

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.750
You...!

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:28.760
You have seen the sad reality of the Mars Sphere.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.680
You now know the reason we fight.

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.680
I will take back the Earth.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:39.100
At the same time, I will ask humanity whether their lives have value.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.270
You must understand my true intentions!

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:43.440
Don't listen to him, Kio!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.700
Lord Ezelcant!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:07.090
Are you all right, Lord Ezelcant?

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:08.800
<i>Yes, I'm fine.</i>

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:11.550
These two are dangerous after all.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.340
Let's dispose of them both here—

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.300
<i>No, that won't be necessary.</i>

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:15.970
Sir?

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:19.430
We will capture Kio alive with the Gundam intact.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.560
Yes, sir.

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:24.230
<i>This is as far as you go, Kio.</i>

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.650
<i>You may quietly surrender.</i>

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:29.150
<i>If you do not...</i>

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:31.360
What should we do?

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.740
Don't worry.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.280
I've got reliable companions.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.330
What?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:48.250
Fire! Fire!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.050
The thing about encircling the enemy is,

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:54.760
if you start poking holes in 'em, they'll fall apart in no time.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:55.890
Pound away at 'em!

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:57.180
Yeah!

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.640
I will deal with Kio.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.100
Exterminate those interfering pirates.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:02.980
Yes, sir!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.540
I must follow Lord Ezelcant's orders!

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.040
I will be your opponent!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:29.540
I'd like to say "No way, I'll pass,"

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:30.960
but it looks like I can't do that.

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:33.630
Mr. Ezelcant.

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.430
Please stop this.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:40.300
I'll tell everyone on Earth about the Mars Sphere.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.850
<i>If I do that, then surely...</i>

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:49.480
I did not start this war so that the
 Vagan people could immigrate to Earth.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:53.400
<i>I do not intend to exterminate the Earthers either.</i>

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:56.320
<i>I will tell you, Kio.</i>

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.570
<i>The truth of my plan: Project Eden.</i>

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:03.330
<i>Project Eden?</i>

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:07.670
Since humanity was born, it has done nothing but fight.{ been doing nothing but fighting.}

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.380
Limited resources and limited land.

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:17.260
Our bloody history is just a constant
 repetition of the struggle for these things.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.890
At this rate, humans will eventually die out.

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:24.770
<i>That is why I took on the task of creating a new human race</i>

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:29.850
<i>made up of intelligent people who will not fight each other.</i>

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:38.400
I've researched on how the parameters of
 intelligence, physical prowess, and DNA makeup

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.370
affects the ability to cope with extreme situations.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.990
Based on those results, I will select a superior human race.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:48.710
I attacked the Nora and Angel{Attacking the colonies Nora and Angel}

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.380
to create those extreme situations.

00:10:56.130 --> 00:11:00.260
I even staged accidents on the Vagan
 colonies to create the same conditions.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.430
Huh?

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:03.470
<i>Why would you do that?!</i>

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:04.930
<i>I already said it.</i>

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:09.520
<i>To select a superior race to shoulder the
 burden of creating a new human history.</i>

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.270
<i>To create a world without war.</i>

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:16.030
<i>A tranquil, peaceful, ideal paradise.</i>

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.440
To create Eden!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:54.060
Is that... Eden?

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:56.520
There will be no Vagan or Federation.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:12:01.950
I will create an ideal paradise fit only for the superior race!{An ideal paradise in which only the superior race may live is what I will create!}

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:33.140
Did you think you could bind the Zamdrag with a tiny wire like that?

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:37.860
As long as it stops your movements for a second!

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:49.030
It looks like you might be able to entertain me, dirty pirate! {www}

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:53.250
This huge thing is annoyingly tough!

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:03.970
Bastard!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.570
Commander! This isn't good!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.530
I know!

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.030
Just hold her together!

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:29.580
How much longer?

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:30.410
Five minutes.

00:13:30.410 --> 00:13:32.830
Damn. It's that guy's fault.

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:36.250
He threw off our calculations!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:42.380
Why do you have to select people?!

00:13:42.380 --> 00:13:45.670
To save humanity from destruction!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:51.810
The selected superior race will purge conflict from human history!

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:58.230
And what's going to happen to those who weren't selected?!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:02.150
In order to realize great ideals, sacrifices are necessary.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:06.070
But all the Vagan trusted you!{Even though all the Vagan believe in you!}

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.820
