00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:26.590
Don't get caught up in the sadness of the present moment.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.090
Imagine it.

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.840
A world without conflict.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:33.890
The smiles of the children who live there.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:35.470
But...

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:36.850
But!

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:41.020
I will make this ideal a reality, even if it costs me my life!

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.440
But!

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:05.750
Kio!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.710
Raddock! {did we have his name from earlier ep?}

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.220
Send out the G-Cepter!

00:15:08.220 --> 00:15:08.880
Roger!

