Hey, Mom.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:16.530
What is it, Romy?

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:21.540
What kind of a place is Earth?

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:25.670
I don't know because I've never been there.

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.380
Romy.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:33.300
Hey, Dad.

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:40.520
I'd like to be reborn on Earth.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:50.320
And of course, I want Mom and Dad to be there too.

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:55.160
Yes, I'm sure we'll live together on Earth, Romy.

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.710
Why do you not understand?!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.840
If you've been reborn...

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:14.050
