00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:16.390
Why do you not understand?!

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.720
There has to be another way!

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:24.640
A way where we don't have to fight!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.600
There is none!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:31.530
History proves that humanity cannot sever the chain of violence!{>using induction}

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:32.360
But!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:34.030
Kio!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.670
Wha—

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:04.020
The Gundam can't keep up with me!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.020
Kio!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.360
Is it ready yet, Raddock?!

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:14.280
<i>Just a bit longer.</i>

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:20.910
Farewell, Kio.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:38.130
Commander, we're all set!

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:39.970
Good. Put me through.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.180
Attention, Vagan:

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.060
Immediately cease all combat activities! {battle actions}

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:46.390
