00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:49.270
<i>Immediately cease all combat activities! {battle actions}</i>

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:49.980
What?

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:56.070
<i>If you do not comply with our demand...</i>

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:12.540
<i>We will ram these asteroids into your colony, Second Moon!</i>

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.500
What?!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.460
You damn cowards!{ something about using cowardly tactics! }{this is a short line}

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:18.920
Sorry.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:22.640
It's the only way to win when we're outnumbered.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.970
I'll be taking Kio back.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.700
<i>Hurry, Captain.</i>

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:41.780
<i>You're the last ones.</i>

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:42.910
<i>I know.</i>

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.830
Okay, I'm on. Go!

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.830
Turn about 180 degrees!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.660
Maximum combat speed!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.120
Let's get out of here! {Roger}

