Oh, I forgot about these.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:09.220
Balloon dummies filled with a chaff smokescreen?

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.560
Those little...{They make fun of us.}

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:13.270
After them! Leave none alive!

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.440
<i>It's useless.</i>

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.860
<i>We can no longer catch up to them.</i>

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:18.900
<i>All troops, return to base!</i>

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:19.860
But...!

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.030
<i>Did you not hear my order?</i>

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:24.820
Yes...{damn questions in the negative}

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:37.290
That's why he should have taken down the Gundam back then.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.730
We did it!

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:54.140
Serves 'em right!

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:57.360
We really showed those Vagan!{We gave those Vagans a big shock! }{i hate this}{I hate you}

