I wonder if those guys can rest in peace now...

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:02.240
Yeah...

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.610
Why the long faces?

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:05.740
Commander!

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:06.990
Get the drinks ready.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:07.570
Huh?

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:11.450
We're outlaws who could die at any time.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:15.170
The best way for us to hold a funeral is to drink and celebrate.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:16.000
Right?

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:17.040
Yeah!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.220
<i>I already said it.</i>

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:32.310
<i>To select a superior race to shoulder the
 burden of creating a new human history.</i>

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:35.480
<i>To create a world without war.</i>

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:37.730
<i>A tranquil, peaceful, ideal paradise.</i>

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:40.650
<i>To create Eden!</i>

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:45.820
<i>I will make this ideal a reality, even if it costs me my life!{you wrote "wll" both times. nice job.}</i>

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.570
I don't understand.

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:51.910
What should I do?

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:04.130
I commend you for volunteering to join our army.

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:06.550
Brave soldiers of Vagan!

